## What else is in the box 

- Framework integrations.`groundingMiddleware` adds retrieval and grounding to any Vercel AI SDK model without changing the rest of your code; there are scorers and guardrails for Mastra.
- Guardrails. Prompt-injection detection and PII redaction, with published precision and recall, plus access-control filtering before anything reaches the model.
- Production details. Hybrid search, reranking, token budgets, timeouts and cancellation, retries, caching, and OpenTelemetry (or Langfuse) traces with the evaluation scores attached.
- The edge. A `/edge` build for Cloudflare Workers, Vercel Edge and Deno.
- Claude, via MCP.`@devilsdev/rag-mcp-server` lets Claude search a folder of your documents and check its own answers against them.
- Take only what you need. The main package has everything; smaller packages like `@devilsdev/rag-eval` (about 6 MB installed) are there if install size matters.
